WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
You came out too late, I asked the bus to take them back first

2
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:03,520
This is what I want to ask you too

3
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:05,000
Why did you come out last?

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,640
Why didn't I see you on the surveillance camera after I came out? Where have you been?

5
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:10,120
When did you become a player? How many times have you experienced dungeons?

6
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:12,120
Do you already have natural abilities?

7
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:14,280
Can you teach me some copy experience?

8
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:16,280
Can I buy it with money? Wait a minute!

9
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:18,680
I know you may feel a little uncomfortable writing it to me.

10
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:21,520
Or maybe you want to tease and scare me, but forget it!

11
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:23,200
What are you talking about? I'm not teasing you

12
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:25,560
What's the tacit basis? If you keep pretending to be stupid, I'm going to get angry!

13
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:27,440
Do you want to tell me what strange disease you have?

14
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:28,840
Why did she suddenly stop giving birth in the middle of talking?

15
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:32,190
Didn't you hear what I just said?

16
00:00:32,190 --> 00:00:33,670
You didn't say anything at all

17
00:00:33,670 --> 00:00:36,110
Just open your mouth and add body language as if you are talking

18
00:00:36,110 --> 00:00:38,510
If a stranger did this suddenly, I might be shocked

19
00:00:38,510 --> 00:00:42,150
But Liang Qiu Xue? He must be having fun and wants to move back to the next game.

20
00:00:42,150 --> 00:00:44,750
Roujia, it’s you who should stop making trouble

21
00:00:44,750 --> 00:00:47,700
How could you not hear that you are a player!

22
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:50,470
If you don't want to say that I won't take the throne

23
00:00:50,470 --> 00:00:52,500
In your eyes, I am that kind of person

24
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:55,980
Look, you're here again. This time, there's no birth in the middle.
